# Keeps build contexts small. The web image builds from the repository root so it
# can reach both frontend/ and the Caddyfile, which makes this file important:
# without it, a local node_modules or target/ would be copied into the builder.

**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/.git
**/.idea
**/*.iml

# Never ship a database, or the temporary files SQLite keeps beside it.
**/data/*.db
**/data/*.db-wal
**/data/*.db-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
